# DAM Integration (Future)

## Abstraction
Media via `src/services/media/`:
```ts
interface MediaService {
  getAsset(id: string): Promise<MediaAsset>;
  getAssetsByTag(tag: string): Promise<MediaAsset[]>;
  getOptimizedUrl(asset, options): string;
}
```

## Asset Type
```ts
interface MediaAsset {
  id: string;
  url: string;
  alt: string;
  width: number;
  height: number;
  mimeType: string;
  tags: string[];
}
```

## Rules
- Use `next/image` with DAM URLs via `getOptimizedUrl`
- Mock service returns static `/images/` paths for now
- Future: Cloudinary, Imgix, or headless CMS media library
- Never hardcode production CDN URLs in components
